ar, Psychic Lobotomy, and Sunder Mind to 10 but will break if you move.\n\t\tThe damage will scale with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"将你的潜意识释放到周围的世界。当此技能激活时，每回合你最多射出 %d 个灵能值球（每个敌方目标一个），造成 %0.2f 精神伤害。每个灵能值球消耗 5 点反馈值。\n\t\t当获得的反馈值超出最大值时，你会产生额外的灵能值球（每个目标每超出 %d 反馈值产生 1 个灵能值球），但是每回合产生的额外灵能值球数量不会超过 %d。\n\t\t此技能运用了灵能通道，所以当你移动时会中断此技能。\n\t\t特别地，当你开启此技能时，心灵灼烧、心灵脑叶切除和碾碎心灵的攻击范围将变为10格。\n\t\t受精神强度影响，伤害按比例加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"014a79973c758e9132e388533e5219a74d17a8b9150fd47fa0866291563efef4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e8895c056fbc64936e6d0abec16466a9a3042ef44436a81f3fc776b39be4c1d2","logical_entry_identity":"8141934f43357d1d9352da2b7dfc4c4c73de2c7d9943f4477f822c20e57c7406","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target's spellpower has been increased by %d.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标的法术强度提升 %d。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3a459afee88f60607fccbd2ba54a97d3c11307fc6f5bdad511b122f63a9354f4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e889bc91c7324736ff6ff23d9cbf154db22a8274acb58e59998bd808af67e898","logical_entry_identity":"02cc91447b5efe48b47edc635d9f6cdd85966716158527178de24e2f08dacc0e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"permanently increase your strength and constitution by three","source_tag":"_t","target":"永久提升你3点力量和体质点数"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4dab1773e60beb9fa1997c7f6180e90b460e72cf3bb13939e20e9fd90ee9472f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e8958201e4e4f0bd484be41b39d1f298c0327f9000df5901a2980af0eacff4b2","logical_entry_identity":"31f7136685ce72158ba29f604e4549ffaa3b81a0256c427dd7ecf77b2d5168d4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"thought-forged bowman","source_tag":"_t","target":"精神体弓箭手"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8cbf41e78906e47f16009d7fd285af6506a5561f6dcee2700626155c39106fc1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e8959a83e245e295592ddf1bc4abd37fd204cdb87b7f1b16e20df58c52602477","logical_entry_identity":"d10c38ab4bab9cd7b5ac87d2aea1b5